              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Ah, the new Initiate! Warms my heart to see a fresh face! The other scholars can be gruff at times, as you may have noted.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IgnusFerric_POL_01.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340968,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I've been examining the Borealis Gemstone Baba Yaga gave me. It's a wonderful little rock, very rare and very magical.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IgnusFerric_POL_02.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340968,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Unfortunately, it's too small for me to really determine its properties. Luckily though, legends speak of a similar gemstone from Mirage.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IgnusFerric_POL_03.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340968,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "It's called the Desert Star, once the Crown Jewel to the first Sand Sultans, but lost long ago. I think we might learn a great deal from it.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IgnusFerric_POL_04.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340968,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Qismah, our Death Scholar, is from Mirage. She has been researching the Desert Star's current location. She can help you recover it.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IgnusFerric_POL_05.mp3",
