  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So you discovered Rasputin's true nature? The Rat, eh? A puppet master? That sounds fitting. Hehe. But what is the Rat's plan in Polaris?",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/BabaYaga_POL_37.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340967,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I believe it's the Borealis Gemstones that are the key. Why was he mining them? We know they're magic, but what kind of magic?",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/BabaYaga_POL_38.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340967,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I gave a small Borealis Gem to our Fire Scholar, Ignus Ferric. Go to the Hall of Pyromancy and see if Ignus had been able to glean anything from it.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/BabaYaga_POL_39.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340967,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Underway",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "What? You want to just wait around until Rasputin and Spider find a way to end the Spiral? Get going then. Speak to Ignus Ferric.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/BabaYaga_POL_40.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
